  "adaptation": "Native root/factory/subscriber and source-owned presentation lease replace Telegram Display window aggregation. UIKit native-stack owns inherited traits; no UIApplication setters, swizzling or JS policy-event latency. Reference and extracted both lock current orientation; only extracted owns hidden status. Status ownership ends at dismissal start; orientation ends on real removal."
